24
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,080
Zhang Hu...

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,440
You...

26
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,760
You should leave.

27
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,640
I'll handle the body.

28
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,750
Come with me !

29
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:06,910
I...

30
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:12,080
I'll stay to clean things up.

31
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,310
I'll find an excuse

32
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,680
so no one will suspect me.

33
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,920
It will be best for both of us.

34
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,230
Fine...

35
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,950
Wang Lin, take care.

36
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,160
It's the law of the jungle

37
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,400
and I might be the next one.

38
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,800
Senior, why can't I condense spiritual energy ?

39
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,520
Senior...

40
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,680
Is there something wrong with my cultivation ?

41
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,750
There's a plant called the Qi Scattering Grass.

42
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,110
If you're poisoned by it,

43
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,120
you can no longer condense spiritual energy

44
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,230
and your cultivation cannot advance.

45
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,190
Someone poisoned you.

46
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:15,070
Do you know who it might be ?

47
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,430
This pill and bag of holding

48
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,990
are gifts for you, my disciple.

49
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:23,830
Listen to me.

50
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:25,840
That cheap master of yours,

51
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:26,950
just kill him !

52
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,080
Senior,

53
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,360
you're knowledgeable.

54
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,510
Do you know

55
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,520
how to cure this poison ?

56
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,320
The only option is to fight poison with poison.

57
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,230
But can you endure the pain ?

58
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,510
As long as I can keep cultivating,

59
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,720
I'm not afraid !

60
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,280
Don't be late for the sect gathering !

61
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,750
The Xuan Dao Sect is arriving soon...

62
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,400
Senior Brother, wait for me !

63
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,270
Hurry up !

64
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,110
Wow !

65
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,030
Wow !

66
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,550
Ouyang Dao from the Xuan Dao Sect

67
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:14,150
has arrived with his disciples.

68
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,760
Look at the sky !

69
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,710
So impressive !

70
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,710
Be quiet,

71
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,830
don't flatter them.

72
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,150
Wow, so impressive !

73
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:44,000
It's the Xuan Dao Sect's guardian beast: the Thousand-legged Centipede.

74
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:47,190
Judging by its size, it must be over 300 years old.

75
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:48,830
Stay away from it,

76
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:51,310
its poison could kill you instantly !

77
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,320
Over 300 years...

78
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,550
This centipede is perfect.

79
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:24,320
Liu Mei
Xuan Dao Sect disciple
12th layer of Qi Condensation

80
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,670
The cultivation world

81
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,760
has such beautiful female cultivators ?

82
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,470
Our prettiest Senior Sister Zhou

83
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,590
doesn't even compare to her pinky.
